# CRUD testing

## Package recommendation

Test CRUD controllers via integration/controller tests that exercise HTTP + Crud execute paths. Test listeners by triggering the relevant `Crud.*` events or full actions.

## Required behavior

- Cover success and failure paths (validation/rule errors, not-found) that the listener/config claims to handle.
- Prefer project existing CRUD test helpers/patterns when present.
- Assert persistence invariants at the Table layer, not only via HTTP.

## Anti-patterns

- Only testing listener methods in isolation when the bug is registration/config
- Skipping Table rule tests because a CRUD UI test passed
